  280	            // The raid planner is the only authority on whether this raid can be carried out at
  281	            // all: it applies the bashing limit, the fleet's own capacity and the profit estimate,
  282	            // and none of those travel in the report projection. Offering a target the planner will
  283	            // decline is how the population came to decide without ever acting -- measured on the
  284	            // grand test at 154 of 181 raid selections producing no work item at all, a third of
  285	            // every decision made. Asking here keeps the candidate list to raids that will actually
